{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(t: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if all elements in the tuple have the same data type using exact type() equality.\n    Raises TypeError if the input is not a tuple.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(t, tuple):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a tuple.\")\n\n    if not t:\n        return True\n\n    first_element_type = type(t[0])\n    for element in t:\n        if type(element) != first_element_type:\n            return False\n            \n    return True"}
