{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def _is_natural(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is a natural number (>= 1).\"\"\"\n    return n >= 1\n\ndef _is_odd(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is odd.\"\"\"\n    return n % 2 == 1\n\ndef sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Natural numbers are defined as integers greater than or equal to 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for n in range(l, r + 1):\n        if _is_natural(n) and _is_odd(n):\n            total_sum += n\n    return total_sum"}
