{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "def max_run_uppercase(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum run of uppercase English characters ('A'-'Z') in a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_run = 0\n    current_run = 0\n    for char in s:\n        if 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            current_run += 1\n        else:\n            max_run = max(max_run, current_run)\n            current_run = 0\n    # After the loop, compare one last time in case the string ends with an uppercase run\n    max_run = max(max_run, current_run)\n    return max_run"}
